语法

    0 $accept: Program $end

    1 Program: ExtDefList

    2 ExtDefList: ExtDef ExtDefList
    3           | %empty

    4 ExtDef: Specifier ExtDecList SEMI
    5       | Specifier SEMI
    6       | Specifier FunDec CompSt
    7       | Specifier FunDec SEMI
    8       | error SEMI

    9 Specifier: TYPE
   10          | StructSpecifier

   11 StructSpecifier: STRUCT OptTag LC DefList RC
   12                | STRUCT Tag
   13                | STRUCT OptTag LC error RC

   14 OptTag: ID
   15       | %empty

   16 Tag: ID

   17 ExtDecList: VarDec
   18           | VarDec COMMA ExtDecList

   19 VarDec: ID
   20       | VarDec LB INT RB

   21 FunDec: ID LP VarList RP
   22       | ID LP RP

   23 VarList: ParamDec COMMA VarList
   24        | ParamDec

   25 ParamDec: Specifier VarDec

   26 CompSt: LC DefList StmtList RC

   27 DefList: Def DefList
   28        | %empty

   29 Def: Specifier DecList SEMI
   30    | Specifier error SEMI

   31 DecList: Dec
   32        | Dec COMMA DecList

   33 Dec: VarDec
   34    | VarDec ASSIGNOP Exp

   35 StmtList: Stmt StmtList
   36         | %empty

   37 Stmt: Exp SEMI
   38     | CompSt
   39     | RETURN Exp SEMI
   40     | IF LP Exp RP Stmt
   41     | IF LP Exp RP Stmt ELSE Stmt
   42     | WHILE LP Exp RP Stmt
   43     | error SEMI
   44     | error RC
   45     | WHILE LP error RP Stmt
   46     | IF LP error RP Stmt
   47     | IF LP error RP Stmt ELSE Stmt

   48 Exp: Exp ASSIGNOP Exp
   49    | Exp AND Exp
   50    | Exp OR Exp
   51    | Exp RELOP Exp
   52    | Exp PLUS Exp
   53    | Exp MINUS Exp
   54    | Exp STAR Exp
   55    | Exp DIV Exp
   56    | LP Exp RP
   57    | MINUS Exp
   58    | NOT Exp
   59    | ID LP Args RP
   60    | ID LP RP
   61    | Exp LB Exp RB
   62    | Exp DOT ID
   63    | ID
   64    | INT
   65    | FLOAT

   66 Args: Exp COMMA Args
   67     | Exp


